    "detailed_description": "End of War 1945 is an Early Access multiplayer shooter focusing on classic, dynamic gameplay in unconventional World War 2 settings. Experience non-stop action with up to 32 players, or take on bots in single player.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2></strong><br><br><u>Up to <strong>32</strong> Player Matches</u><br>Intense combat for matches of all sizes.<br><br><u><strong>12</strong> Maps</u><br>Unique locations focused on lesser known battles set in Italy, Germany, and Yugoslavia.<br><br><u><strong>3</strong> Nations</u><br>Play as Germany, the USA, the United Kingdom, Italy, the Yugoslav Partisans, and more. Each faction has their own arsenal of weapons to choose from.<br><br><u><strong>5</strong> Game Modes</u><br>A balance of Deathmatch and nonlinear/linear objective gameplay.<br><br><u><strong>Full Bot Support</strong></u><br>Play with AI opponents and teammates on all game modes.<br><br><u><strong>Historical Authenticity</strong></u><br>Authentic weapons, uniforms, and historically immersive World War 2 setting.",
    "about_the_game": "End of War 1945 is an Early Access multiplayer shooter focusing on classic, dynamic gameplay in unconventional World War 2 settings. Experience non-stop action with up to 32 players, or take on bots in single player.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2></strong><br><br><u>Up to <strong>32</strong> Player Matches</u><br>Intense combat for matches of all sizes.<br><br><u><strong>12</strong> Maps</u><br>Unique locations focused on lesser known battles set in Italy, Germany, and Yugoslavia.<br><br><u><strong>3</strong> Nations</u><br>Play as Germany, the USA, the United Kingdom, Italy, the Yugoslav Partisans, and more. Each faction has their own arsenal of weapons to choose from.<br><br><u><strong>5</strong> Game Modes</u><br>A balance of Deathmatch and nonlinear/linear objective gameplay.<br><br><u><strong>Full Bot Support</strong></u><br>Play with AI opponents and teammates on all game modes.<br><br><u><strong>Historical Authenticity</strong></u><br>Authentic weapons, uniforms, and historically immersive World War 2 setting.",
    "short_description": "End of War 1945 is a WW2 FPS focusing on 6v6 classic casual gameplay (Support for up to 32 players), intense action, open and unique maps, and a historically authentic setting. The Early Access release is set in Germany, Yugoslavia, and Italy during the final months of the war.",
